  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jzFvQVgYwC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/jzFvQVgYwC</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>THE MYSTHICAL</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>喚醒你內心的煉金術師！嘗試礦石、化學物質和有機材料，探索它們的力量，打造更強大的工具、護符等。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/704/311/themysthical.png\" width=\"693\" height=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">新增怪物、魔法戒指、魔法法杖和可附魔元素的劍、寵物霍姆庫魯斯等更多內容。</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1015/937/2024-11-15_13.png\" width=\"1111\" height=\"573\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.9minecraft.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/The-Mysthical-Mod-Screenshots-18.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"186\"></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1015/947/les-creaturas2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1111\" height=\"740\">全新霍姆庫魯斯，每個都具有獨特特性。</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.9minecraft.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/The-Mysthical-Mod-Screenshots-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"403\"><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>煉金術師</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>教學指南：</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsfYmFenZUVtcle9YdPDIrw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsfYmFenZUVtcle9YdPDIrw</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>完整評測與教學（西班牙語）</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n76JnuxN_1U?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/747174331343437876/848020279024025670/jare.png?width=101&amp;height=141\" alt=\"e\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如何使用煉金術工作台：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WM_InmPdiZY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如何製作霍姆庫魯斯</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PeiMQQsK1Kg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>魔法法杖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2rO-8CD33YM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>新快照</strong></span></p><p>魔法武士刀已從物品欄移除。</p><p>劍升級系統已移除。</p><p>新增3種物品：</p><p>火焰精華：由烈焰使者掉落<br>冰霜精華：由流髑掉落<br>暗影精華：由凋靈骷髏掉落</p><p>這些精華用於在劍附魔台上賦予魔法劍力量，取代原有升級系統。</p><p>新增按鍵綁定</p><p>Y鍵：魔力解放</p><p>啟動力量，穿戴銀製物品時效果增強。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>最新更新</p><p>新增魔法法杖！！！！！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>最新更新</p><p>新增魔法項鍊</p><p>新增魔力充電器</p><p>新增食屍鬼和吸血鬼</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/724/956/2023-09-05_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
